---
title: Async Log Flow – logger.log(entry)
---

sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Caller Thread
    participant L as PostgresAuditLogger
    participant S as Semaphore
    participant V as Virtual Thread
    participant D as PostgreSQL

    C->>L: log(entry)

    alt semaphore configured
        L->>S: tryAcquire()
        alt permit available
            S-->>L: true
        else no permit
            alt FAST_FAIL
                L-->>C: failedFuture(AuditLoggingException)
                Note over L: errorCallback.accept(ex)
            else BLOCK (default)
                L->>S: acquire() [blocking]
                Note over C: caller thread blocked
            end
        end
    end

    L->>L: toJson(changes) + toJson(metadata)
    Note over L: sync, in caller thread

    L->>V: runAsync(insert, executor)
    L-->>C: CompletableFuture

    opt caller awaits result
        C->>C: .join() or .get(timeout)
    end

    activate V
    V->>D: getConnection()
    V->>D: INSERT INTO audit_log (…)
    D-->>V: done
    deactivate V

    V->>L: whenComplete → semaphore.release()
    L->>S: release()

    alt SQL error
        V->>V: AuditLoggingException
        Note over V: log.error() + errorCallback
    end
